        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgeley%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Sykes bought 45,000 acres of Northern Pacific Railway land for about one dollar per acre, shaping the town’s early growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
